gtit.command.unknown=Unknown subcommand: %s. Use /gtit help for supported commands.
gtit.command.help.title=GTIT commands (commands require OP2; gift and preset management default to OP2, configurable OP2-4; default trade reset requires the owner / OP4)
gtit.command.gift.intro=Use /gifts to browse and manage gifts. These commands restore starter gift rewards or manage claim records.
